name: Supplied advisory metadata stays unverified, bounded and outside Map progress
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/ndiff_metadata.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 READY THE MAP RUN | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: use ndiff
submit: run .
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 Choose an exact tool | explicit-action-required
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/ndiff_metadata.py @TMP_TARGET @ART before
paste-file: @ART/valid-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | explicit-metadata-consent
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Unverified supplied metadata | supplied-record
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/ndiff_metadata.py @TMP_TARGET @ART valid
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | metadata-receipt
expect: Labeled owned metadata.
ask: Does the metadata receipt distinguish supplied claims from verified source evidence, start no model or network work, and attach no Map continuation?
resize: 160x48
live-snap: metadata-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: metadata-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: metadata-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: metadata-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | metadata-40x12
expect: Unverified
keys: NPage
live-snap: metadata-page-1-40x12
expect-not: Stream: healthy
keys: NPage
live-snap: metadata-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: metadata-page-3-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/ndiff_metadata.py @TMP_TARGET @ART readability
ask: Is the supplied-metadata result readable through paging at all six sizes, with support and evidence limits reachable?
resize: 120x36
paste-file: @ART/mismatch-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 descriptor-declared effect | explicit-mismatch-consent
keys: y
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 25 does not match requested | identity-mismatch
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/ndiff_metadata.py @TMP_TARGET @ART mismatch
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
keys: PPage PPage
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | valid-metadata-retained
ask: Does an identity mismatch remain an honest failed attempt while preserving the earlier supplied record, with no silent fallback fetch?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 READY THE MAP RUN | restarted-setup
paste-file: @ART/replay-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Outcome · completed | recovered-metadata
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/ndiff_metadata.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restart
ask: Does no-color restart retain supplied metadata and the mismatch receipt in fresh Setup without another request or new phase progress?
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 10 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | explicit-restart-quit
keys: y
require-exit: 10
